1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,995
The second attempt used the same set of instruments in a different environment, and the total looked modest on paper.

2
00:00:06,995 --> 00:00:12,079
“We are not building a nuclear plant,” the director said.

3
00:00:12,079 --> 00:00:25,213
“We are trying to keep one island of dry ground dry.” A pair of boots, a narrow pack, and a straight line on a map: that was the whole plan.

4
00:00:25,213 --> 00:00:29,013
The environmental setting was the difficulty.

5
00:00:29,013 --> 00:00:35,707
“The resistance of this soil to water is a mathematical joke,” the geologist said.

6
00:00:35,707 --> 00:00:47,796
“The rain will soak it, and the wet season will destroy the shore road.” The destruction of the last shed by the flood was still visible from the station.

7
00:00:47,796 --> 00:00:56,295
The team measured the steam and the emission of the old pump, and found the discharge of warm water into the narrow channel.

8
00:00:56,295 --> 00:01:01,449
“A revolutionary approach is not needed,” the boatman said.

9
00:01:01,449 --> 00:01:03,879
“A passive one is.

10
00:01:03,879 --> 00:01:08,699
The tolerance of this bank is almost used up.”

11
00:01:08,699 --> 00:01:21,797
The despair of the second week was real: a nest of birds drowned in the ditch, a fountain of mud in the yard, and the calm surface of the canal hiding a soak of water underneath.

12
00:01:21,797 --> 00:01:27,902
“The surroundings do not care about our schedule,” Maya wrote.

13
00:01:27,902 --> 00:01:35,001
The greenhouse on the ridge had survived, and its salty liter of water had condensed by morning.

14
00:01:35,001 --> 00:01:40,655
“Excite the volunteers with the small successes,” the director said.

15
00:01:40,655 --> 00:01:47,045
“The big ones are rare, and the small ones contain the whole method.”

16
00:01:47,045 --> 00:01:56,824
The second attempt added discrimination to the model: eight sites, seven gauges, two banks, and one rule.

17
00:01:56,824 --> 00:02:06,593
A bit of oil on the hinge of the gate, a drive to the west shore, and the plant on the riverbed were all part of the same activity.

18
00:02:06,593 --> 00:02:14,052
Its might was its modesty, and it was, probably, the last attempt of the season.

19
00:02:14,052 --> 00:02:26,960
The essential point was the integration of the two surveys, and the power of the argument was against a soluble answer: five trees, one ass, and a bitter joke about the weather.

20
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:38,772
The tree by the gate and the sediment in the water had to be measured in the same week, and the whole attempt was probably a lesson in humility rather than a plan.
